WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Expand a supplier’s Delivery timing &amp; exceptions in location settings.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.458
Step 2: Set lead time in calendar days, Order cutoff and expected Delivery time. Same-day cutoffs must be earlier than arrival.

3
00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:23.708
Step 3: For Tuesday/Friday delivery with one day’s lead time and a 2 pm cutoff, order before Monday 2 pm for Tuesday. After that, Friday is the next eligible estimate.

4
00:00:23.708 --> 00:00:29.708
Step 4: Save settings and check Order by and Estimated delivery in the cart and review.
